        {"zh": "尾鞭抽在你腰侧", "en": "Its tail cracks across your ribs."},
        {"zh": "头冠一低，撞你胸口", "en": "Crests down, it slams your chest."},
        {"zh": "咬住，然后甩头", "en": "It bites, then whips its head."}
